/Title (Waitrr is a mobile ordering and payment platform widely used in Singapore's F&B industry. It allows customers to browse menus, place orders, and make payments directly from their smartphones, either for dine-in or takeaway. By facilitating pre-ordering and contactless transactions, Waitrr significantly reduces queue times and enhances the dining experience. The app also integrates with loyalty programs and POS systems, providing added value to both customers and businesses.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1296 0 R
>>
